### Create user [POST]

This is to post a new user

+ Request (application/json)

        {
            "first_name":"Marco",
            "last_name":"Polo",
            "username":"polo",
            "password":"password",
            "email":"marco@polo.com"
        }

+ Response 201 (application/json)

    + Body

            {
                "user_id":2,
                "first_name":"Marco",
                "last_name":"Polo",
                "username":"polo",
                "email":"marco@polo.com",
                "user_image_path":NULL
            }

