## Join league [/barcelona/leagues/{id}/join]
### Join league [POST]

This is to let a user join a league in current city. Sets initial Elo rating based on skill level chosen.
(Beginner: 700, Intermediate: 1000, Advanced: 1300)

+ Request (application/json)

        {
            "user_id":10,
            "league_id":2,
            "initial_elo":1000
        }

+ Response 201 (application/json)

    + Body
               
            {
                "user_id":1,
                "league_id": 8,
                "sport_name":"New League!",
                "data":{
                    "current_elo":1000,
                    "matches_played":0,
                    "matches_won":0,
                    "matches_lost":0,
                    "matches_drawn":0
                    },
                "elo_history": [
                    {
                      "date":"2018-08-18T22:00:00Z",
                      "score":1000
                    }
                    ]
                
            }     

