## Create a new match [/versus]


### Create Match [POST]

This is to post a new Match

+ Request (application/json)

        {
            "league_id":1,
            "user1_id": 2,
            "user2_id": 3
        }

+ Response 201 (application/json)

    + Body

            {
                "match_id":5,
                "league_id":1,
                "sport_name":"Tennis", 
                "user1":{
                    "user_id":1,
                    "score":null,
                    "new_elo":null
                },
                "user2":{
                    "user_id":3,
                    "score":null,
                    "new_elo":null,
                    "image_path":"https://www.republica.com/wp-content/uploads/2018/01/fotonoticia_20180122090433_1920.jpg",
                    "username": "minnie"
                },
                "match_datetime": "0000-00-00 00:00:00",
                "location": null,
                "status":"PENDING",
                "winner_id":null
            }
            
            
## Accept match  [/matches/{id}/accept]

### Accept match [PUT]

This is to change the status of one match to 'accepted'.

+ Response 200 (application/json)

        {
            "match_id":5,
            "sport_name": "Juggling",
            "league_id":1,
            "user1":{
                "user_id":3,
                "username":"federerer",
                "score":null,
                "new_elo":null
            },
             "user2":{
                "user_id":1,
                "username":"versus",
                "score":null,
                "new_elo":null
            },
            "match_datetime": "0000-00-00 00:00:00",
            "location": null,
            "status":"ACCEPTED",
            "winner_id":null
        }
        
## Reject match  [/matches/{id}/reject]

### Reject match [PUT]

This is to change the status of one match to 'denied'.

+ Response 200 (application/json)

        {
            "match_id":5,
            "sport_name": "Juggling",
            "league_id":1,
            "user1":{
                "user_id":3,
                "username":"federerer",
                "score":null,
                "new_elo":null
            },
             "user2":{
                "user_id":1,
                "username":"versus",
                "score":null,
                "new_elo":null
            },
            "match_datetime": "0000-00-00 00:00:00",
            "location": null,
            "status":"DENIED",
            "winner_id":null
        }
        
        
