            "location": null,
            "status":"DENIED",
            "winner_id":null
        }         
    
    
## Set match date, time and location  [/matches/{id}/set]

### Set match date, time and location [POST]

This is to set match date and time ('YYYY-MM-DD HH:MM:SS') and location when match is accepted.

+ Request (application/json)

        {
            "match_datetime": "2018-08-18 12:05:00",
            "location": "Passeig de Sant Joan, 20, Barcelona, Spain"
        }

+ Response 200 (application/json)

        {
            "match_id":5,
            "league_id":1,
            "user1":{
                "user_id":1,
                "score":null,
                "new_elo":null
            },
             "user2":{
                "user_id":2,
                "score":null,
                "new_elo":null
            },
            "match_datetime": "2018-08-18T10:05:00.000Z",
            "location": "Passeig de Sant Joan, 20, Barcelona, Spain",
            "status":"ACCEPTED",
            "winner_id":null
        }    
        
        
## Finish match  [/matches/{id}/finish]

### Finish match [POST]

This is to change status of one match to 'finished'. Adds match results.

+ Request (application/json)

         {
            "league_id":1,
            "user1":{
                "user_id":1,
                "score":3
            },
             "user2":{
                "user_id":2,
                "score":1
            }
        }

+ Response 200 (application/json)

    + Body

            {
                "match_id":5,
                "league_id":1,
                "user1":{
                    "user_id":1,
                    "score":3,
                    "new_elo":1024
                },
                "user2":{
                    "user_id":2,
                    "score":1,
                    "new_elo":1176
                },
                "match_datetime": "2018-08-18T10:05:00.000Z",
                "location": "Passeig de Sant Joan, 20, Barcelona, Spain",
                "status":"FINISHED",
                "winner_id":1
            }
            
            